  "details": "The content gating system has come out and needs some polish, and to also loosen up.\n\nI believe things like horror, gore and violence should not be something locked away from teenagers as this is just an asset of life. At most, content gating should prevent minors from accessing and/or seeing adult content like sexual activities.\n\nEdit: After much discussion in the VRchat discord, I think I can fix this up a little more.\n\nThe Gate should be tiered between 13+ 16+ and 18+\n\nSince VRchat is an American based game, it should follow American rating regulations.\n\nMPAA is the American rating system.",
